OL,5,G1400 Record Review
OL,6,     FAndrew McGregor with the best new
OL,7,     Fclassical releases. He's joined by
OL,8,     FAndrew Matthews-Owen and Charlotte
OL,9,     FGardner, who surveys Vivaldi's
OL,10,     FCello Concertos and makes a top
OL,11,     Fchoice.
OL,12,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,13,     FEdith Bowman presents a mix of
OL,14,     Fmovie music. This week, composer
OL,15,     Fand musician Anne Dudley joins to
OL,16,     Fdiscuss Thomas Newman's score to
OL,17,     F'Road to Perdition' in
OL,18,     F'Harmonising Hollywood'.
